orthant 1 language

-       An enumeration of `NetForward` (shown `→`, from `-->`), `BothDirections` (`⇄`, from
-       `<=>`), `Equilibrium` (`⇋`, from `<~>`), `Stoichiometric` (`=`, from `===`) and
-       `Resonance` (`↔`, from `<->`). Which arrow a chemist writes carries meaning, and an
-       equation keeps it.
-   entry .showable   shows a reaction as its arrow
+       Una enumeración de `NetForward` (que se muestra `→`, de `-->`), `BothDirections` (`⇄`, de
+       `<=>`), `Equilibrium` (`⇋`, de `<~>`), `Stoichiometric` (`=`, de `===`) y `Resonance`
+       (`↔`, de `<->`). La flecha que escribe un químico tiene significado, y una ecuación la
+       conserva.
+   entry .showable   muestra una reacción como su flecha
